      "frame": "Reality Check: what has been observed, and who holds the record of it. So far the observed facts are one accusation and no forensic report. The question is not whether OpenAI is guilty. It is who is in a position to find out.",
      "why": "It keeps me from presuming the hack, which would be overclaiming and break Tier 1. It also turns the Accelerationist's strongest attack, 'no evidence,' into my main point: the evidence sits with the accused. That puts the asymmetry of power and information on the table without any claim about motives."
